@startuml
title MaquiControl - Billing Management Bounded Context\nDatabase Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho
hide circle

entity "invoices" as invoices {
  * id : BIGINT <<PK, IDENTITY>>
  --
  * rental_id : BIGINT <<EXTERNAL REF, UNIQUE>>
  invoice_number : VARCHAR(30)
  sunat_cdr : VARCHAR(100)
  * amount : DECIMAL(12,2) <<NOT NULL>>
  * currency : CHAR(3) <<NOT NULL>>
  * status : VARCHAR(20) <<NOT NULL>>
  issued_at : TIMESTAMP
  * created_at : TIMESTAMP <<NOT NULL>>
}

entity "late_penalties" as late_penalties {
  * id : BIGINT <<PK, IDENTITY>>
  --
  * rental_id : BIGINT <<EXTERNAL REF>>
  * amount : DECIMAL(12,2) <<NOT NULL>>
  * currency : CHAR(3) <<NOT NULL>>
  * reason : VARCHAR(300) <<NOT NULL>>
  * applied_at : TIMESTAMP <<NOT NULL>>
  * created_at : TIMESTAMP <<NOT NULL>>
}

note right of invoices
  Constraints:
  PK (id)
  UNIQUE (rental_id)
  CHECK (amount >= 0)
  CHECK (currency IN ('PEN', 'USD'))
  CHECK (status IN
    PENDING, ISSUED, REJECTED)
  CHECK (
    status <> 'ISSUED'
    OR (invoice_number IS NOT NULL
        AND issued_at IS NOT NULL)
  )

  rental_id references Rental
  in Rental Management.
  No cross-context database FK is created.
end note

note right of late_penalties
  Constraints:
  PK (id)
  CHECK (amount >= 0)
  CHECK (currency IN ('PEN', 'USD'))

  rental_id references Rental
  in Rental Management.
  No cross-context database FK is created.
end note

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | PK | Primary Key |
  | IDENTITY | Database-generated numeric identifier |
  | FK | Foreign Key |
  | EXTERNAL REF | Identifier owned by another bounded context |
  | NOT NULL | Mandatory column |
  | UNIQUE | Value cannot be repeated |
endlegend

@enduml
